    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 8.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hire bearn mon ofslea, gi\e/ḷde cyninge þara medrenmæge dǽl; fædrenmægum hiora dǽl mon agife.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If her child is killed, let the mother’s portion [of the wergild] be given to the king; let the father’s kin be given their portion.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If her child is slain, the share of the wergeld due to the mother's kindred shall be paid to the king, but the father's kindred shall be paid the same due to them.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hire bearn mon ofslea, gylde (þam) cyninge ðara medrenmæge dæl; fædrenmægum hiora dæl mon agife.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
